### Variabel Lingkungan Lokal
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@authToken = super-secret-lenix-token-2026

### 1. Test GET Portfolio (Tetap Terbuka untuk Publik Tanpa Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/portfolio

### 2. Test Admin TANPA Token (Harus Mengembalikan 401 Unauthorized)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/hero
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Lead Gameplay Programmer",
  "description": "Coba akses tanpa login"
}

### 3. Test Admin DENGAN Token Valid (Harus Berhasil 200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/hero
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Lead Gameplay Programmer & Systems Architect",
  "description": "Fokus pada arsitektur data-driven Unity C# dan REST API performa tinggi."
}

### 4. Test Hapus Skill DENGAN Token Valid
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/skills/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}